      "created_at": "2013-03-19T13:55:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I know everyone is super excited about ST right now being the new set and all but I just wanna put some praise out there for an older set.</p><p>I decided to get Rook City along with Shattered Timelines just to try it out and I'm so glad I did.</p><p>Spite is my new favorite villian now. Kudos on his design. I just really enjoy going up against a hulk like character that just wants to watch the world burn.</p>",
